{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bonki is trapped in your screen with the legendary meme character, BONK!</strong><br>There\u2019s no way out for them, the only thing they can do is bonk each other. Once you start clicking and press a key on your keyboard, Bonki and BONK will launch into a full-on bonk war. But that\u2019s not all! There are even some gems hidden in their bonk battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Digital ownership of Bonki and BONK</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Virtual Mechanical Keyboard Sound</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize the characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tune your own virtual sound effects for your keyboard</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fun little companion on your screen while you play, create, or even work</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect costumes and unlock achievements</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rarity Item Drops:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Common</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rare</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legendary</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UltraBonk</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"FIRST BONK","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3683690/0845feeb2e4a72e37bcf4712eba804609ebae006.jpg"},{"name":"TEN BONK","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3683690/0845feeb2e4a72e37bcf4712eba804609ebae006.jpg"},{"name":"HUNDRED BONK","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3683690/0845feeb2e4a72e37bcf4712eba804609ebae006.jpg"},{"name":"FOUR TWENTY BONK","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3683690/0845feeb2e4a72e37bcf4712eba804609ebae006.jpg"},{"